{
  "category": "Worm Pokémon",
  "entries": [
    {
      "text": "Its short feet are tipped with suction pads that enable it to tirelessly climb slopes and walls.",
      "version": "red"
    },
    {
      "text": "Its short feet are tipped with suction pads that enable it to tirelessly climb slopes and walls.",
      "version": "blue"
    },
    {
      "text": "If you touch the feeler on top of its head, it will release a horrible stink to protect itself.",
      "version": "yellow"
    },
    {
      "text": "For protection, it releases a horrible stench from the antenna on its head to drive away enemies.",
      "version": "gold"
    },
    {
      "text": "Its feet have suction cups designed to stick to any surface. It tenaciously climbs trees to forage.",
      "version": "silver"
    },
    {
      "text": "It crawls into foliage where it camouflages itself among leaves that are the same color as its body.",
      "version": "crystal"
    },
    {
      "text": "CATERPIE has a voracious appetite. It can devour leaves bigger than its body right before your eyes. From its antenna, this POKéMON releases a terrifically strong odor.",
      "version": "ruby"
    },
    {
      "text": "CATERPIE has a voracious appetite. It can devour leaves bigger than its body right before your eyes. From its antenna, this POKéMON releases a terrifically strong odor.",
      "version": "sapphire"
    },
    {
      "text": "Its voracious appetite compels it to devour leaves bigger than itself without hesitation. It releases a terribly strong odor from its antennae.",
      "version": "emerald"
    },
    {
      "text": "It is covered with a green skin. When it grows, it sheds the skin, covers itself with silk, and becomes a cocoon.",
      "version": "firered"
    },
    {
      "text": "Its short feet are tipped with suction pads that enable it to tirelessly climb slopes and walls.",
      "version": "leafgreen"
    },
    {
      "text": "It releases a stench from its red antenna to repel enemies. It grows by molting repeatedly.",
      "version": "diamond"
    },
    {
      "text": "It releases a stench from its red antenna to repel enemies. It grows by molting repeatedly.",
