    {
      "text": "Caterpie has a voracious appetite. It can devour leaves bigger than its body right before your eyes. From its antenna, this Pokémon releases a terrifically strong odor.",
      "version": "omega-ruby"
    },
    {
      "text": "Caterpie has a voracious appetite. It can devour leaves bigger than its body right before your eyes. From its antenna, this Pokémon releases a terrifically strong odor.",
      "version": "alpha-sapphire"
    },
    {
      "text": "When attacked by bird Pokémon, it resists by releasing a terrifically strong odor from its antennae, but it often becomes their prey.",
      "version": "sun"
    },
    {
      "text": "It’s easy to catch, and it grows quickly, making it one of the top recommendations for novice Pokémon Trainers.",
      "version": "moon"
    },
    {
      "text": "Perhaps because it would like to grow up quickly, it has a voracious appetite, eating a hundred leaves a day.",
      "version": "ultra-sun"
    },
    {
      "text": "Its body is soft and weak. In nature, its perpetual fate is to be seen by others as food.",
      "version": "ultra-moon"
    },
    {
      "text": "If you touch the feeler on top of its head, it will release a horrible stink to protect itself.",
